            <profile id="d15d-5d16-e017-fdd2" name="Equipment and options (as printed in WAB2 army list)" publicationId="fcb9-17be-94c2-bcfc" hidden="false" typeId="b19e-ee0c-17d1-6e33" typeName="Equipment and Notes">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">All have a hand weapon, javelins and throwing spears. May have shield (+1). Light Cavalry are Light Cavalry and have Feigned Flight. In Lithuanian armies, Light Cavalry may upgrade to WS3 and Ld7 (+3) and Light Cavalry and Noble Cavalry may dismount (-11) replacing javelins and throwing spears with bow.</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
            <profile id="2a65-b3fc-910d-c884" name="Armour Save" hidden="false" typeId="0dbe-f4ed-ef08-8e86" typeName="Armour Save">
